  "title": "Glasser’s Greek Marlin",
  "description": "This marlin recipe is made with marlin steaks cooked in garlic butter sauce and topped with tomato and basil. This fish is terrific served with Greek olives and feta cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Jim Glasser"
  ],
